message.content:
先建立新的資料夾 `Archived_Quarter1`，然後將 `Quarter1_Reports` 資料夾裡的所有文字檔複製進去。

```json
{
  "name": "mkdir",
  "arguments": {
    "dir_name": "Archived_Quarter1"
  }
}
```

接著列出 `Quarter1_Reports` 裡所有 `.txt` 檔案：

```json
{
  "name": "find",
  "arguments": {
    "path": "Quarter1_Reports",
    "name": "*.txt"
  }
}
```

最後把每一個找到的檔案複製到新資料夾：

```json
{
  "name": "cp",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "Quarter1_Reports/Report1.txt",
    "destination": "Archived_Quarter1/Report1.txt"
  }
}
```

（重複上述 `cp` 指令，對每一個檔案進行複製。）

